[I] A Linux SVG-based theme engine for Qt and KDE

[T] Kvantum is an SVG-based theme engine for Qt, KDE and LXQt with an
[T] emphasis on elegance and customizability. It comes with many built-in
[T] themes and Kvantum Manager, a GUI for selecting and configuring themes.

[U] https://github.com/tsujan/Kvantum

